{"id":"809f5c1aa673552a","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-clique-np-complete.md","title":"thm-clique-np-complete (CLIQUE is NP-Complete)","display":"thm-clique-np-complete (CLIQUE is NP-Complete)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-clique]]","[[28-df-3sat]]","[[28-df-np-complete]]","[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","[[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]]"],"display":"thm-clique-np-complete (CLIQUE is NP-Complete)","label":"28-thm-clique-np-complete","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-clique-np-complete","CLIQUE is NP-complete","CLIQUE NP-completeness"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1e536fad96aebabd\" href=\"?note=1e536fad96aebabd\" title=\"28-df-clique\">28-df-clique</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5408daacba221251\" href=\"?note=5408daacba221251\" title=\"28-df-3sat\">28-df-3sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8db0d5d40e579d59\" href=\"?note=8db0d5d40e579d59\" title=\"28-thm-3sat-np-complete\">28-thm-3sat-np-complete</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-clique-np-complete (CLIQUE is NP-Complete)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-clique-np-complete"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-clique-np-complete</span><span>CLIQUE is NP-complete</span><span>CLIQUE NP-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{3SAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{3SAT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 见本目录对应定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{3SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{CLIQUE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{3SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{CLIQUE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 证据边界：文字相容图的局部归约已复核；NP 难性沿用 3SAT 与 Cook–Levin 的证明边界。因此本条保留为有来源的定理记录，不作为本次已完整核验的证明依赖。</p>\n<p>本地归约：对含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个子句的 3CNF，每个子句中的每个文字出现各设一顶点；仅在不同子句且文字不互为否定的顶点间连边，阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>。满足赋值在每个子句选一个真文字给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 团；反向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 团必须每子句选一顶点，所选文字相容并可延拓为总赋值。空子句导致某子句没有顶点，故不可能有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 团；空 CNF 映到空图及阈值零，为真例。给顶点编号即可得到标准图编码。无效语法映到固定否例，使归约全定义。团顶点表可在多项式时间检查。</p>\n<p>来源核对：习题2.15及提示；印刷65、532页；PDF91、558页。题目陈述已核对；此处直接文字相容图为本地推导，原书提示从INDSET归约。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-clique","status":"resolved","id":"1e536fad96aebabd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-clique]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-3sat","status":"resolved","id":"5408daacba221251","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-3sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-3sat-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"8db0d5d40e579d59","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{3SAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLIQUE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NPComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{3SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{CLIQUE}.","display":true},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false}],"bytes":1735,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"NP 完全性：[[28-thm-clique-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-vertex-cover-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-independent-set-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-hamiltonian-cycle-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-3coloring-np-complete]]。"},{"id":"a93b83e8c9de9da6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1e536fad96aebabd","5408daacba221251","7a9125ebbfdef91e","14088421136f8182","8db0d5d40e579d59"]}